                        .font(.subheadline)
                        .fontWeight(.semibold)
                    Text(summary.isProductionReady
                         ? "\(summary.storageAccessNeededCount) original source lane(s) are remembered outside the vault. Preview uses proxies; grant folder access only for relink, waveform-from-originals, or raw-source operations."
