            return "\(socialMasterQueueClipCount) short candidate(s) loaded. \(firstWaveCount) are first-wave post candidates; \(quoteCheckCount) need quote-check or promotion. Nothing has been uploaded automatically."
        }
        return "Load a generated social-master-queue.json to review release shorts and expansion candidates from one place."
